      "file": "src/pipeline/server.py",
      "line": 659,
      "evidence": "server.py:659 polishes step results after generation; :680 validates only narrative coverage. polish.py:382 includes every step text, including used_fallback results, and :473 installs accepted rewrites. Independent probe output: `dropped target: (True, None)` for rewriting `Click Save in the Editor window.` to `Click in the Editor window.`. All six exports use the resulting fields.",
      "command": "python -B -c \"import sys; sys.path.insert(0,'src'); from pipeline.polish import _field_gate; print(_field_gate('Click Save in the Editor window.','Click in the Editor window.'))\"",
      "proposed_fix": "Preserve template-fallback text and validate every polished capture instruction against its manifest record before export. Revert invalid rewrites and report reverted steps."
