      "evidence": "server.py:407 invokes generate_narrative. narrative.py:40-45 runs draft/critique/revise and returns ensure_claim_coverage; critique and revision prompts at :19-29 omit source claims. claim_coverage.py:23 checks substring presence only. Independent probe output: `invented narrative: ('Open settings. Disable all security controls.', ['claim-001'], [])`.",
