      "line": 530,
      "evidence": "Photo results use `\"text\": caption or per_step.get(step.id) or \"(no description provided)\"` with no narration field. :544 obtains the overview through generate_title_and_overview using the steps client, rather than generate_narrative. The export call at :595-605 omits claims; :617 defaults claims to (). Thus successful captions suppress placed human instructions, and overview omissions/additions are ungated.",
