      "title": "Narrative failures bypass coverage, and the sidecar omits narrative flags and photo fallbacks",
      "file": "src/pipeline/server.py",
      "line": 407,
      "evidence": "At :407 `_verify_ids` is discarded; :412-413 sets narrative_text=None on failure; :423 builds report verification claims only from placement_meta. Placed narration may still preserve source text, so total document loss is not universal. When polish is enabled, :680 validates the None narrative; an independent probe returned `AttributeError 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'lower'`. Photo results set used_fallback at :531 but hardcode an empty fallback report at :578.",
      "command": null,
