      "line": 216,
      "evidence": "Independent probe returned `{'s1': 'Open settings. Save the changes.'}` for a two-step manifest, followed by the warning that the whole transcript landed on step 1. server.py:776 replaces placement only if semantic alignment succeeds; :792 otherwise returns the original mapping. Shared ollama_probe.txt reports `TcpTestSucceeded False`.",
      "command": "python -B -c \"import sys; sys.path.insert(0,'src'); from types import SimpleNamespace as S; from pipeline.transcript import align_transcript_to_steps; m=S(steps=[S(id='s1'),S(id='s2')],step_ids=lambda:['s1','s2']); print(align_transcript_to_steps('t.txt','Open settings. Save the changes.',m))\"",
