      "evidence": "models.toml selects qwen3:32b for steps, qwen3.6:27b for narrative, qwen2.5vl:7b for vision, and optional gemma3:12b polish. USER_MANUAL.md:641 and CLAUDE.md:67-68 instead document qwen3:32b narrative. Shared evidence states `model tags CANNOT be verified live`. Historical vision measurements and July 11 polish comments establish historical testing only; no nonexistent-tag claim is made.",
