      "title": "Stage concurrency limits do not establish a 40 GB residency budget",
      "file": "src/pipeline/llm_client.py",
      "line": 104,
      "evidence": "close() executes only `self._client.close()`. The payload at :80 is `{\"model\": self.config.model, \"messages\": messages, **kwargs}`. Capture scheduling can alternate steps, narrative placement, steps title, narrative, and optional polish models. models.toml:23 limits step concurrency to 1 and :36 sets vision concurrency to 4, but neither controls retained models. Live quantization, residency, eviction, and peak memory remain unmeasured; polish is disabled by default.",
      "command": null,
