      "title": "Project metadata omits runtime dependencies and the requirements file mixes dependency roles",
      "file": "pyproject.toml",
      "line": 5,
      "evidence": "The [project] section declares only name, version, and requires-python. requirements.txt separately pins runtime packages, pyinstaller at :9, numpy at :7, and faster-whisper at :17. A source search for Transcriber and direct NumPy imports returned only `src\\pipeline\\transcription.py:7:class Transcriber:`. Absence of direct NumPy imports does not prove absence of transitive requirements.",
