      "title": "Environment proxies can route local-only capture and model traffic outside the LAN",
      "file": "src/pipeline/llm_client.py",
      "line": 49,
      "evidence": "llm_client.py:49-53 creates httpx.Client with base_url, transport, and timeout but no trust_env=False. vision.py:62 and capture/upload.py:62 likewise create clients without disabling environment proxy handling. Production transport defaults to None. An external proxy environment setting without a matching bypass can therefore route LAN-bound prompts, screenshots, and uploads through that proxy. No actual proxy configuration or egress is established by this audit.",
